{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53001","headline":"题杜舍人林亭 · 钱起","name":"题杜舍人林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来访龙楼客，时逢酒瓮新。\n花齐云入幕，苔径竹迎人。\n鹊喜娇迟日，莺啼惜暮春。\n不须耽小隐，南院在平津。\n（见元骆天骧《类编长安志》卷九胜游类樊川范公五居条引，据《中国古都研究》收黄永年先生《述〈类编长安志〉》一文转引。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}